        "Description": "Our client has issued a contract to take out entrepreneur Jason Portman, after the reckless handling of sensitive customer data at his E-commerce corporation many users are furious. While some have taken a more pacifist route by atacking him on social media, our client seems to have reacted strongly and wants him retired permanently. Hes companion Daniele Carco, AKA the &quot;Chaos Agent&quot; also needs to be put down, as our client fears he will continue Jasons behavior after his death. Good luck!",
